WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:14.272
and Bajie looked all around.

2
00:00:15.113 --> 00:00:17.815
But the Tang Monk was gone.

3
00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:20.697
"That tiger ate our master," said Bajie.

4
00:00:21.937 --> 00:00:22.498
He shrugged.

5
00:00:22.518 --> 00:00:25.480
"I guess we don't have to protect him anymore.

6
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.341
Good-bye, Wukong!"

7
00:00:29.983 --> 00:00:31.444
pig started to walk away.

8
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:33.989
But Wukong grabbed him.

9
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:35.731
not leaving!"

10
00:00:36.011 --> 00:00:36.691
said the monkey.

11
00:00:36.711 --> 00:00:39.314
"We have to save our master.

12
00:00:40.114 --> 00:00:43.937
That tiger said he works for a demon, the great king Yellow Wind.

13
00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:46.639
The king's cave must be nearby."

14
00:00:50.563 --> 00:00:52.824
The tiger entered his master's cave.

15
00:00:53.885 --> 00:00:56.768
The Tang Monk was slumped over the tiger's shoulder.

16
00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:01.932
The great king Yellow Wind was sitting on his throne.

17
00:01:03.312 --> 00:01:04.192
"Great king!"

18
00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:05.453
cried the tiger.

19
00:01:05.473 --> 00:01:07.874
"I found the Tang Monk!"

20
00:01:09.515 --> 00:01:12.256
The demon king looked surprised and happy.

21
00:01:12.276 --> 00:01:16.778
"I have heard that anyone who eats the Tang Monk will live forever.

22
00:01:17.778 --> 00:01:19.039
Was the monk alone?"

23
00:01:19.059 --> 00:01:23.200
"He had two companions," said the tiger.

24
00:01:24.401 --> 00:01:25.001
is a pig.

25
00:01:25.581 --> 00:01:26.742
The other is a monkey."

26
00:01:28.442 --> 00:01:29.923
Yellow Wind trembled.

27
00:01:29.943 --> 00:01:31.364
"A monkey?"

28
00:01:31.744 --> 00:01:32.204
he said.

29
00:01:33.044 --> 00:01:38.267
"He must be Sun Wukong—the monkey who caused all that trouble in Heaven!"

30
00:01:38.287 --> 00:01:40.989
"Maybe," said the tiger.

31
00:01:41.009 --> 00:01:43.670
"But don't worry.

32
00:01:44.731 --> 00:01:47.172
distracted them with a fake tiger skin.

33
00:01:48.313 --> 00:01:49.834
They'll never find us."

34
00:01:51.535 --> 00:01:54.837
The tiger patted his stomach and looked at the Tang Monk.

35
00:01:54.857 --> 00:01:59.900
"I'll tell the other demons to start a fire and prepare some spices."

36
00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:03.001
Wind held up his hand.

37
00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:06.162
"Sun Wukong is powerful.

38
00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:09.744
He and that pig might come looking for the monk.

39
00:02:11.244 --> 00:02:13.345
They'll be angry if they find out we ate him.

40
00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:17.567
Let's wait until they leave the area.

41
00:02:18.387 --> 00:02:21.208
Then we'll be able to enjoy our meal."

42
00:02:22.529 --> 00:02:25.230
small demon ran into the throne room.

43
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:29.191
"Great king!"

44
00:02:29.532 --> 00:02:31.556
cried the demon.

45
00:02:31.616 --> 00:02:35.358
"There are two strangers outside—a monkey and a pig.

46
00:02:36.278 --> 00:02:38.099
They said to hand over the Tang Monk.

47
00:02:38.999 --> 00:02:42.500
If we don't, they'll destroy our entire mountain!"

48
00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:46.802
"Oh no," moaned Yellow Wind.

49
00:02:46.822 --> 00:02:48.823
"This is bad!"

50
00:02:50.184 --> 00:02:52.224
worry, King," said the tiger.

51
00:02:52.244 --> 00:02:54.325
"I will get rid of them."

52
00:02:56.206 --> 00:02:58.187
tiger walked out of the throne room.

53
00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:05.444
The small demon followed him.

54
00:03:05.544 --> 00:03:09.125
Outside the cave there was some yelling and then a crashing sound.

55
00:03:11.186 --> 00:03:14.167
A moment later the small demon ran back in.

56
00:03:14.187 --> 00:03:17.328
"Great king, disaster!"

57
00:03:17.548 --> 00:03:18.068
he cried.

58
00:03:19.049 --> 00:03:20.169
tiger is dead!

59
00:03:21.029 --> 00:03:24.110
The pig killed him with his rake!"

60
00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.191
cried Yellow Wind.

61
00:03:26.771 --> 00:03:32.348
He stood up and grabbed a trident.

62
00:03:32.588 --> 00:03:35.690
puffed out his chest and stomped out of the cave.

63
00:03:37.292 --> 00:03:38.352
He saw Wukong.

64
00:03:38.412 --> 00:03:44.777
"So you're the monkey who caused all the trouble in Heaven," said Yellow Wind.

65
00:03:44.797 --> 00:03:47.238
"Hand over the Tang Monk!"

66
00:03:47.559 --> 00:03:48.659
demanded Wukong.

67
00:03:48.679 --> 00:03:52.822
"I didn't know you were so small," said Yellow Wind.

68
00:03:55.004 --> 00:03:56.785
me on the head," said the monkey.

69
00:03:56.805 --> 00:03:58.146
"I'll grow bigger."

70
00:03:59.067 --> 00:04:00.668
The demon king hesitated.

71
00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:02.241
"Go ahead!"

72
00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:03.341
said Wukong.

73
00:04:05.363 --> 00:04:07.364
Wind knocked the monkey on the head.

74
00:04:08.685 --> 00:04:10.626
Instantly Wukong grew tall.

75
00:04:12.247 --> 00:04:13.248
I'll hit you!"

76
00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:14.569
cried Wukong.

77
00:04:15.229 --> 00:04:16.830
He swung his iron bar.

78
00:04:19.712 --> 00:04:22.154
The demon king blocked the bar with his trident.

79
00:04:24.435 --> 00:04:26.837
The two fought up and down the side of the mountain.

80
00:04:26.857 --> 00:04:30.860
"I'll use some magic," thought the monkey.

81
00:04:31.552 --> 00:04:34.113
He grabbed a handful of hair and blew on it.

82
00:04:36.433 --> 00:04:39.854
Dozens of little Wukongs ran toward the demon king.

83
00:04:40.955 --> 00:04:42.335
Yellow Wind laughed.

84
00:04:43.535 --> 00:04:46.076
"I know a magic trick too!"

85
00:04:47.116 --> 00:04:49.377
He looked down and blew three times.

86
00:04:55.558 --> 00:04:56.759
sky grew dark.

87
00:04:57.719 --> 00:05:01.900
A powerful yellow wind whipped across the mountain.

88
00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.901
Trees snapped and rocks tumbled.

89
00:05:05.022 --> 00:05:09.264
Wukong, Bajie, and all the little Wukongs tumbled down the mountain.

90
00:05:10.305 --> 00:05:13.146
They landed at the bottom in a cloud of dust.

91
00:05:19.229 --> 00:05:23.532
The demon king went back into his cave and slammed the door shut.
